      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Bonjour. I'm Liam, in for Kumar Karthik. Gold or silver: it's one of the first choices you make for a SERS substrate. The answer depends less on the metal than on your laser. Here's why.",
      "new_visual_element": "Composer: gold or silver?",
