    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "VERDICT",
      "narration_text": "Here's the verdict. Don't pick a metal in isolation. Match it to your laser, check the match on your real, aggregated substrate, and weigh brightness against stability. Silver at five thirty-two and gold at seven eighty-five are good defaults, not laws.",
